Attached is our redline of the Pinewood Dairy Cooperative mutual NDA (Pinewood_Tessera_NDA_WSGR_redline_2026-03-16.docx) together with a clean copy. Ben has reviewed.

Open items, all minor:
1. Term: reduced from five years to three, consistent with your other customer NDAs.
